{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Contactmend 是一款以備份為先的重複聯絡人修復工具，適合電話簿長期累積大量重複記錄、又擔心合併出錯的用戶。它會說明每個配對建議的原因，讓你可並排比較兩邊記錄，並由你親自選擇保留哪一筆，合併前更會先將原始記錄備份到本機。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-212.webp\">\n<h2>合併前先備份更安心</h2>\n<p>Contactmend 以備份為先，只以正規化後的電話號碼與電郵地址配對，名稱相近的記錄一律鎖定，並在合併前顯示衝突。內置練習模式無須取用聯絡人權限，可先熟習審查流程。寫入前會把原始記錄存為本機 vCard 備份並記錄交易日誌；若記錄已被修改，自動還原會被攔截，避免誤覆蓋新編輯。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-240-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-241-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-242-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-243-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-244-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-245-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Contactmend: Safe Merge</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T17:39:55.565794+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":346,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:26:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T19:37:44.009093+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T17:38:14.919433+00:00","content_hash":"8a52e5c28cef5040787dcd2bf3044f025fda1effd57ecf6cfa2ad6535e6b8ded","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}